{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3kW4BMViuZRE1nEVAX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, weathered door. A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*Do you have it?*\n\n*The right one turns me. The wrong one breaks inside me forever. I have swallowed so many wrong keys. They rattle when the wind blows.*\n\n*I do not open for force. I do not open for pleading.*\n\n*I open for the key.*\n\n*Do you have it?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":545,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}